Package: peerreview
Title: The Effect of Peer Review on Open-Source Community Engagement
Version: 0.0.5.008
Authors@R: c(
    person("Mark", "Padgham", , "mark.padgham@email.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-2172-5265"))
  )
Description: Code to analyse GitHub issue activity across open-source
    ecosystems (CRAN, npm, PyPI, JOSS, rOpenSci) in relation to
    repository "popularity" metrics and, for rOpenSci, formal
    peer-review status.
